tm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Frozen_rain_covering_hawthorn_berries.jpg/500px-Frozen_rain_covering_hawthorn_berries.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Hawthorn berries covered in icy glaze due to freezing rain. Ice storms often coat many surfaces. Severe ice storms, which may occur in spring, can kill plant life.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFrozen_rain_covering_hawthorn_berries.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}